                <pb facs="0415" n="343" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg343"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Greek Government to the four protecting
                        powers.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1909-08-18"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi> 18,
                            1909</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In response to the proposition of the great protecting powers the Royal
                    Government hastens to submit for their high appreciation the following
                    considerations in reply to the communication which the Imperial Ottoman
                    Government has addressed to it on the subject of the attitude of Greece in both
                    Macedonia and Crete.</p>
                <p>(Here follows text of the Greek note of this date to the Turkish Government.)</p>
            </div>
